OL,3,CMan charged after crash in Huyton
OL,4,Cwhich killed four people
OL,6,FA man has been charged after a crash
OL,7,Fin Huyton which killed four people
OL,8,Flast month.
OL,10,FPolice received reports that a black
OL,11,FCupra Formentor had hit a lamppost on
OL,12,FEast Prescot Road, Huyton in the early
OL,13,Fhours of Friday 24 July.
OL,15,FJack Diggle, 23, Benjamin Dooley, 23,
OL,16,FAndrew Roberts, 24, and Craig
OL,17,FShackleton-Brady, 26 died at the scene.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
