OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786342684
OL,3,CMan charged after crash in Huyton
OL,4,Cwhich killed four people
OL,6,FJames Diggle, 27, from West Derby,
OL,7,Fwill appear at Liverpool Magistrates
OL,8,FCourt on Saturday 8 August charged
OL,9,Fwith four counts of aiding and
OL,10,Fabetting causing death by dangerous
OL,11,Fdriving.
OL,13,FMerseyside Police said: "As criminal
OL,14,Fproceedings are now active, we would
OL,15,Fask that the public refrain from
OL,16,Fcommenting on, or speculating about,
OL,17,Fthe circumstances of this case online,
OL,18,Fas this could unintentionally
OL,19,Fprejudice the judicial process.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
